  addition. This owner denotes the named manufacturer-associated concentrate at that
  source scope. The source does not specify a catalogue number, exact cholesterol
  content, organism origin or complete formulation; none is inferred from current
  manufacturer examples. The 0.1% is the receiving dose, not a concentration of the
  supplied concentrate. Named material curation does not require an exact ontology
  product term.'
